    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Discord &amp; Chat With Dev!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/f977c68810557ce36ed8bb69652d8a95.avif?t=1745912018\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/308cb1af4d1565e5370d64bb72a95a9a.avif?t=1745912018\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world full of monsters, always look for better weapons &amp; skillstones that gain your enemy's ability. Even you can spit poison like the poisonous spider, so slash all of them and look for it. Sharpen your weapon, upgrade your status, and gain experience until you become a Professional Mercenary in this single-player, Action RPG, Hack n Slash Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt and Slash Your Enemies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Mercenary, slashing your enemy is a top priority. Hunt them, slash them all, and hopefully, they drop something good for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ba9cbf674532ebfb11e232afcdf3d865.poster.avif?t=1745912018\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ba9cbf674532ebfb11e232afcdf3d865.webm?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ba9cbf674532ebfb11e232afcdf3d865.mp4?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Look for better weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your future quests, stronger monsters might be hard to deal with. Prepare yourself by looking for stronger weapons that can be obtained from the market or monster drops. There are 30+ weapons you can choose from three types, each of which has its advantages. One-Handed, Two-Handed, or Spear.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/48573701fcddefa791150d0d0cce92de.avif?t=1745912018\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade things</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your weapon, upgrade your character status, upgrade your character Inventory, and gain experience until you become a Professional Mercenary and master the way of monster slaying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/09acea39c5591bfab9a7ec7b82b7c6bd.poster.avif?t=1745912018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/09acea39c5591bfab9a7ec7b82b7c6bd.webm?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/09acea39c5591bfab9a7ec7b82b7c6bd.mp4?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Skillstones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many monsters can do something. Poison spitting, teleporting behind your back, diving on the land, Dashing, and many more cunning abilities, but you can do that if you use a Skillstone. Equip five from 40+ Skillstones to change the way you approach your enemy. Master it and become stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4b28642b5c49ac8941863c18aa031b59.avif?t=1745912018\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pet Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for a young monster and put it in a cage, but don't forget to feed it properly... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/5cd5f0839bd5752239116c28dba57d87.poster.avif?t=1745912018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/5cd5f0839bd5752239116c28dba57d87.webm?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/5cd5f0839bd5752239116c28dba57d87.mp4?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lot of monsters with different abilities that can be mastered.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Weapons to use. One-handed Sword, Two-handed Sword, or Spear? choose wisely.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Skillstones to master. Poison spitting, summoning, and much more can be mastered using skillstones.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many things to upgrade! Your weapons, potions, inventory, and your character are upgradeable.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pettable monsters! Monsters can become your pet if you find them young.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/308cb1af4d1565e5370d64bb72a95a9a.avif?t=1745912018\" data-has-big width=800 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world full of monsters, always look for better weapons &amp; skillstones that gain your enemy's ability. Even you can spit poison like the poisonous spider, so slash all of them and look for it. Sharpen your weapon, upgrade your status, and gain experience until you become a Professional Mercenary in this single-player, Action RPG, Hack n Slash Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt and Slash Your Enemies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Mercenary, slashing your enemy is a top priority. Hunt them, slash them all, and hopefully, they drop something good for you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ba9cbf674532ebfb11e232afcdf3d865.poster.avif?t=1745912018\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ba9cbf674532ebfb11e232afcdf3d865.webm?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/ba9cbf674532ebfb11e232afcdf3d865.mp4?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Look for better weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your future quests, stronger monsters might be hard to deal with. Prepare yourself by looking for stronger weapons that can be obtained from the market or monster drops. There are 30+ weapons you can choose from three types, each of which has its advantages. One-Handed, Two-Handed, or Spear.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/48573701fcddefa791150d0d0cce92de.avif?t=1745912018\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade things</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your weapon, upgrade your character status, upgrade your character Inventory, and gain experience until you become a Professional Mercenary and master the way of monster slaying. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/09acea39c5591bfab9a7ec7b82b7c6bd.poster.avif?t=1745912018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/09acea39c5591bfab9a7ec7b82b7c6bd.webm?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/09acea39c5591bfab9a7ec7b82b7c6bd.mp4?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Skillstones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many monsters can do something. Poison spitting, teleporting behind your back, diving on the land, Dashing, and many more cunning abilities, but you can do that if you use a Skillstone. Equip five from 40+ Skillstones to change the way you approach your enemy. Master it and become stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/4b28642b5c49ac8941863c18aa031b59.avif?t=1745912018\" data-has-big width=800 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pet Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for a young monster and put it in a cage, but don't forget to feed it properly... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/5cd5f0839bd5752239116c28dba57d87.poster.avif?t=1745912018\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/5cd5f0839bd5752239116c28dba57d87.webm?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952740/extras/5cd5f0839bd5752239116c28dba57d87.mp4?t=1745912018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lot of monsters with different abilities that can be mastered.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Weapons to use. One-handed Sword, Two-handed Sword, or Spear? choose wisely.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Skillstones to master. Poison spitting, summoning, and much more can be mastered using skillstones.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many things to upgrade! Your weapons, potions, inventory, and your character are upgradeable.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pettable monsters! Monsters can become your pet if you find them young.</p></li></ul>",
